<title>UK: Cellnet says connects 74,000 in Q2.</title>
<headline>Cellnet says connects 74,000 in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cellnet, Britain's second-biggest mobile telephone company which is 60-percent owned by British Telecommuncations Plc, said on Tuesday it had connected a net new 74,000 customers in the second quarter of the year.</p>
</text>
